            "reviewBody": "I also did a half and half mixture of light sour cream and half plain greek yogurt, a splash of vanilla extract. Instead of the sugar, I used Truvia, a 0 calorie natural sweetner. Reduces calories by alot . We have this for breakfast, snacks, and desserts. My whole family loves it.",
